      "title": "The Core Idea",
      "content": "OpenScholar is a <strong>retrieval-augmented language model</strong> that assists scientists in synthesizing the growing body of literature. It achieves this by <strong>identifying relevant passages</strong> from a large corpus of papers and <strong>generating citation-backed responses</strong>.",
